e":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5132,"speakerName":"ソニィ","textMapHash":3640450570,"text":"#ルカさん、お客さんの面前で、あまり失礼なことをしないように。{M#彼たち}{F#彼女たち}に不快な思いをさせてはなりませんよ。","nextNodeIds":[740090311]},{"nodeId":740090311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5131,"speakerName":"ルカ","textMapHash":3800112954,"text":"了解。","nextNodeIds":[740090312]},{"nodeId":740090312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1725832058,"text":"ふん！ヴァージル、悪事を働いたことを反省してるか！","nextNodeIds":[740090313]},{"nodeId":740090313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21027,"speakerName":"ヴァージル","textMapHash":3479562802,"text":"ああ、全部私のせいだ、私が悪かった…どうか許してくれ…","nextNodeIds":[740090314]},{"nodeId":740090314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3627767434,"text":"しっかり反省してるならいいぞ。二度と同じマネをするんじゃないぞ！","nextNodeIds":[740090315]},{"nodeId":740090315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5132,"speakerName":"ソニィ","textMapHash":1686154210,"text":"#パイモンさん、{NICKNAME}さん——親愛なるヴァージルさんが二度とそんなことをしないと、この「白手袋」のソニィ、そして私の父と息子の名誉に誓って保証いたしましょう。","nextNodeIds":[740090316,740090317]},{"nodeId":740090316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2772028978,"text":"行こう、パイモン…","nextNodeIds":[740090320]},{"nodeId":740090320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1228852218,"text":"おう！ありがとな、ソニィ、ルカ。やっぱりフォンテーヌには悪いやつよりいい人のほうが多い気がするぜ！","nextNodeIds":[740090321]},{"nodeId":740090321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5132,"speakerName":"ソニィ","textMapHash":1917730922,"text":"#さようなら。また手を組む機会があることを願っています。親愛なるパイモンさん、{M#尊敬する紳士}{F#可愛らしいお嬢さん}。","nextNodeIds":[740090322]},{"nodeId":740090322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21027,"speakerName":"ヴァージル","textMapHash":3896322770,"text":"ひぃっ…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":740090317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3595679210,"text":"どうするつもりなの？","nextNodeIds":[740090318]},{"nodeId":740090318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5132,"speakerName":"ソニィ","textMapHash":3274531194,"text":"#世間を生きながら、すべてを分かりきってしまえば、あまりに面白くないでしょう？{M#尊敬する紳士}{F#可愛らしいお嬢さん}。","nextNodeIds":[740090319]},{"nodeId":740090319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5132,"speakerName":"ソニィ","textMapHash":3638378178,"text":"もしどうしても知りたいなら、まずは彼とゆっくり…お話をするつもりです。これ以上、あなた方の時間を無駄にしないでおきましょう。","nextNodeIds":[740090320]}]},{"talkId":7400904,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":true,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7400905","3","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_LOCAL","id":7400904,"initDialog":740090401,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[21247,21248],"performCfg":"","priority":5,"questId":74009,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":740090401,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5132,"speakerName":"ソニィ","textMapHash":1587796346,"text":"さあ、親愛なるヴァージルさん…あなたは本当に手を焼かせてくれますね。あなたをどうすればいいでしょうか？","nextNodeIds":[740090402]},{"nodeId":740090402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21027,"speakerName":"ヴァージル","textMapHash":607759682,"text":"す、すまん…","nextNodeIds":[740090403]},{"nodeId":740090403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5132,"speakerName":"ソニィ","textMapHash":924822794,"text":"あらら、それはいけませんね。あなたもご存じの通り、光陰矢の如し、今さら後悔したところで取り返しはつきません。我々にも我々なりの正義があり、絶対に手を出してはならない商売があるんですよ。","nextNodeIds":[740090404]},{"nodeId":740090404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21027,"speakerName":"ヴァージル","textMapHash":51062210,"text":"で…でも、ソニィさん、どうか聞いてくれ。この商売の利益は…","nextNodeIds":[740090405]},{"nodeId":740090405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5132,"speakerName":"ソニィ","textMapHash":1010344586,"text":"はぁ、まったく。モラ、モラ、モラ、モラ、モラって、それ以外あなたにとって大事なものはないのですか？フォンテーヌ人としてのプライドはどうしました？このドリンクによって我々の同胞がひどい目に遭ってもいいと言うのですか？","nextNodeIds":[740090406]},{"nodeId":740090406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5131,"speakerName":"ルカ","textMapHash":3394666146,"text":"チッ！","nextNodeIds":[740090407]},{"nodeId":740090407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5132,"speakerName":"ソニィ","textMapHash":756661994,"text":"あら？珍しいですね。ルカさんがあなたのためにこれほど豊かな感情を表現してくれましたよ。親愛なるヴァージルさん、あなたは誠にすごいことを成し遂げましたね。","nextNodeIds":[740090408]},{"nodeId":740090408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21027,"speakerName":"ヴァージル","textMapHash":2747486882,"text":"ソニィさん、し…信じてくれ。ぜ、全部あの卑劣なやつらの仕業だ。わ、私はあいつらに騙されて…","nextNodeIds":[740090409]},{"nodeId":740090409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5132,"speakerName":"ソニィ","textMapHash":3144112578,"text":"役立たずが！黙りたまえ！","nextNodeIds":[740090410]},{"nodeId":740090410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21027,"speakerName":"ヴァージル","textMapHash":427774690,"tex